  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I look at his parents and can’t help but think of my dad. I wish he had someone special to spend his days with. He still",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 246
        }
      ],
      "words": 40
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“They tried to control my life. Eloise mostly, but my dad did nothing to stop her. You know how it was.” I lift my brows",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2800
        }
      ],
      "words": 46
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Eloise had screamed at me and called me names every day of my life. I’d had enough of it. She never believed I could be",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3087
        }
      ],
      "words": 55
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“She convinced me I wasn’t good enough for anyone or anything. I know that isn’t true now. There will probably always be",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3767
        }
      ],
      "words": 49
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I haven’t said anything because I wanted to wait until I had the ball rolling, but I’ve decided something and it’s big,",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4329
        }
      ],
      "words": 40
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Our squadron was sent out one day—” He pauses, his jaw slack. “Do you know what an IED is?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6796
        }
      ],
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“That’s what got Nolan killed. He was the only casualty.” He looks down at his feet, sighing again. “He was nineteen. He",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7225
        }
      ],
      "words": 28
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Why him? He had a girl waiting for him back home. He was taking college courses. He wanted a family",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7906
        }
      ],
      "words": 20
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He smiles again, but this time it’s completely genuine. “And then",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8389
        },
        {
          "text": "you walked into the shop.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8453
        }
      ],
      "words": 15
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Who’s going to chop these onions? I vote for you, because you’re already crying.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9051
        }
      ],
      "words": 14
    }
  ],
